Omission
- [N1] Omitted trace (input 0): i1:To initiate the process, begin by processing incoming orders. -> i2:Once the order is received, proceed to send the collected order list. -> i3:After collecting the order list, implement it in the database. -> i4:Once the data is implemented, gather all the information in one excel-file. -> i5:Subsequently, check the order and customer details. -> i6:If the "permit data" option is selected, proceed with permitting the data. -> i8:After implementing the data in the database, release the data if permitted or contact the selling agency if not permitted. -> i9:Once the agency is contacted, check the worth of the orders. -> i10:If the orders are to be released, continue with the process. -> i12:After checking the worth of the orders, if the value is less than 5000, continue with the process. -> i16:Once the order is signed off, collect the order and start production. -> i17:Send the memorandum and invoice, followed by the quality report. -> i18:Check the quality of the production and send the quality report. -> i19:Once production has started, send the memorandum and collect the goods. -> i20:Sign off on the memo and pick the goods. -> i21:After the goods are picked, send them to complete the process.
- [N2] Omitted trace (input 1): i1:To initiate the process, begin by processing incoming orders. -> i2:Once the order is received, proceed to send the collected order list. -> i3:After collecting the order list, implement it in the database. -> i4:Once the data is implemented, gather all the information in one excel-file. -> i5:Subsequently, check the order and customer details. -> i6:If the "permit data" option is selected, proceed with permitting the data. -> i8:After implementing the data in the database, release the data if permitted or contact the selling agency if not permitted. -> i9:Once the agency is contacted, check the worth of the orders. -> i10:If the orders are to be released, continue with the process. -> i14:However, if the value is greater than or equal to 5000, the order will need to be signed off by the board of directors. -> i16:Once the order is signed off, collect the order and start production. -> i17:Send the memorandum and invoice, followed by the quality report. -> i18:Check the quality of the production and send the quality report. -> i19:Once production has started, send the memorandum and collect the goods. -> i20:Sign off on the memo and pick the goods. -> i21:After the goods are picked, send them to complete the process.
